      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Digby%2C_Nova_Scotia",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town’s name honors Admiral Robert Digby, whose HMS Atalanta helped establish the community.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        2,
        5
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.digby.ca/town-history.html",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Digby’s harbor still hosts a historic scallop fishing fleet that fuels the local economy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
